  "body": "<blockquote>\nI think we should support them. I didn't make them a MUST in the spec... was a use case given?\n</blockquote>\n\n\nAnybody have an actual usecase for non-standard baudrates? Currently, the ones in the spec are not required for the implementation, but we'd like to see some real world use cases first. \n\nIf we allow baudrates explicitly, I think we should list the standard baudrates nonetheless. \n",
